DESCRIPTION:The Emerald Coast Beerfest has been pouring at Seville Quarter
  for thirty years\, which makes it older than most of the breweries at it
 . Over fifty breweries and homebrew clubs set up across the complex for a
  three hour session\, and the festival runs as a fundraiser. General and 
 VIP admission are both sold\, and the prices live on the ticketing page r
 ather than the festival's front page.\nPrice: not published by the venue\
